# Push and dist

When a change is finished (UI, API, copy, or anything meant to go live), do not wait for «пуш» / «дист»:

1. Commit the relevant files (no secrets, no empty commits).
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch.
3. Build the Hostinger dist:

```
$env:VITE_API_URL="https://api.mindkeep.cloud"; npm run build -w client; Copy-Item client/public/.htaccess client/dist/.htaccess
```

Leave Hostinger upload of `client/dist` to the user. Do not force-push. Skip this loop only for questions, plans, or work the user says not to ship.
